    board_vulkan_spec_manual_honesty_and_docgen_stub_2026-08-11, 1, "2026-11-13: On release/1.0.0 35144b7f5e9, Linux aarch64 seed af717f53d6bce3e5: test/01_unit/os/vulkan/cross_arch_boundary_substitution_spec.spl 4/4 passed and spipe_docgen reports Generated 1 docs (1 complete, 0 stubs) for it. The committed doc/06_spec manual was not regenerated here: spipe_docgen main emits a different, shorter layout than the committed one (drops the folded Executable SSpec scenario blocks), so swapping it in would lose content."

